  "summary": "The identified studies apply boosted decision-tree ensembles to the task of estimating battery remaining life. Research by Gupta et al. (2024) and Adebayo et al. (2026) reports accuracy and AUROC metrics on the CellLife and GridWatch datasets, respectively [V0085, V0087]. Haddad et al. (2025) evaluates the method on ToxiBench, reporting MAE [V0086], while Brennan et al. (2018) reports F1 on ProtMap [V0088]. Fischer et al. (2023) applies the same method to agricultural yield, representing a distinct application domain [V0038].",
